The simple method, which we talked about first, is doing all of this for you behind the scenes. If you run ``small-c'' }{\cs19\fs20\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2 \hich\af2\dbch\af2\loch\f2 configuration}{, you will have a file called }{
