ariety of ways to control your Apache server. We'll focus on a script that ships with Apache, called }{\cs19\fs20\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2 \hich\af2\dbch\af2\loch\f2 apachectl}{
, which does a few other things in addition to just starting, stopping, and restarting.
